<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 3mth BUBOR rate down, 1mth, 3mth flat.</title>
<headline>Hungary 3mth BUBOR rate down, 1mth, 3mth flat.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) edged down on Tuesday for the three-month maturity and was steady for one and six months, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was unchanged at 20.51 percent, the three-month rate down 0.01 percent at 20.03 percent and the six-month rate steady at 19.69 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
